Portrait of a fantasy D&D character. A tall, thin male elf with long black hair tied back with a stolen silk ribbon. Permanent smirk, eyes that never smile — cold and calculating behind the charm. Theatrical posture, one hand raised mid-gesture. Wearing elegant clothes that are visibly dirty and stained (he lives in sewers). Pale skin, sharp elven features. Holding a wooden flute in his other hand. Background: dark stone sewer tunnel with faint green light. Style: realistic fantasy portrait, dramatic lighting, waist-up.
